  "notes": "Verb type: {一段動詞|いちだんどうし} (ichidan verb)\nTransitivity: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive) - takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ for the person being flattered\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{媚|こ}びる: to fawn over, curry favor with\n- {媚|こ}び⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{売|う}る→売る：00906_uru⟧: to ingratiate oneself\n- {媚|こ}びへつらう: to fawn and flatter (compound verb)\n\nCONNOTATION:\nUsually negative, suggesting insincerity or excessive obsequiousness.",
